@EmailService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5212
@InternalKey = spst-dev-internal-key-change-me

### Health
GET {{EmailService_HostAddress}}/health

### Status (staff JWT)
GET {{EmailService_HostAddress}}/api/emails/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send (internal)
POST {{EmailService_HostAddress}}/api/internal/emails/send
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Api-Key: {{InternalKey}}

{
  "to": "peter@spst.sk",
  "toName": "Peter",
  "subject": "Test",
  "bodyText": "Ahoj z EmailService."
}

### Loan due reminder (internal)
POST {{EmailService_HostAddress}}/api/internal/emails/templates/loan-due-reminder
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Api-Key: {{InternalKey}}

{
  "bookingId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "bookId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "borrowerEmail": "peter@spst.sk",
  "borrowerName": "Peter Dinis",
  "dueDate": "2026-12-01T00:00:00Z",
  "bookTitle": "1984"
}
